# The public signing key is served byte for byte (public/ and the landing
# copy both ship as /parkproof-public-key.pem). With core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows a checkout rewrote it with CRLF, so the live file was 182 bytes
# against 178 in the repo. Keep it LF in every working tree.
*.pem text eol=lf
# Shebang scripts and shell scripts must keep LF, or the first line ends in a
# stray CR on Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) and Node, Vitest and bash
# fail to parse them.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
